1
00:00:00,086 --> 00:00:03,926
(Barry:)Before we start, I just want to
warn you, fencing isn't a joke.

2
00:00:03,923 --> 00:00:05,723
(Barry:)I hope you're not here because
you think it's going to be

3
00:00:05,725 --> 00:00:07,655
like Star Wars.

4
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:08,560
(Leonard:)That's not why we're here.

5
00:00:08,561 --> 00:00:09,761
(Raj:)Yeah, I'm here
because I think

6
00:00:09,762 --> 00:00:11,592
(Raj:)it's gonna be like
Game of Thrones.

7
00:00:11,597 --> 00:00:13,967
(Howard:)And maybe
a little Princess Bride.

8
00:00:13,966 --> 00:00:15,766
Ooh, ooh! I forgot
about Princess Bride!

9
00:00:15,768 --> 00:00:18,298
That's my answer!

10
00:00:18,304 --> 00:00:22,544
Well, sorry to disappoint you,
but fencing is a serious sport.

11
00:00:22,541 --> 00:00:23,571
If you're not willing
to put in the effort,

12
00:00:23,576 --> 00:00:25,676
you might as well just leave
now.

13
00:00:25,678 --> 00:00:27,908
(Sheldon:)We're not afraid of physical activity.
Yeah.

14
00:00:27,913 --> 00:00:30,513
(Howard:)I already ran 18 miles today.

15
00:00:31,616 --> 00:00:34,216
All right. Let's begin
with some fundamentals.

16
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,550
(Barry:)This is the en
garde position.

17
00:00:36,555 --> 00:00:39,525
Feet are in an "L."
Heels in a straight line.

18
00:00:39,525 --> 00:00:40,495
(Barry:)Elbow is
about a fist

19
00:00:40,493 --> 00:00:42,093
from the rib cage.

20
00:00:42,094 --> 00:00:45,124
(Barry:)Notice my dominant
leg faces forward.

21
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:46,160
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear.

22
00:00:46,165 --> 00:00:47,465
What's wrong, Cooper?

23
00:00:47,466 --> 00:00:50,866
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm not sure
I have a dominant leg.

24
00:00:50,870 --> 00:00:52,770
(Sheldon:)They're both pretty submissive.

25
00:00:55,173 --> 00:00:56,573
(Howard:)When you're in a
public restroom,

26
00:00:56,575 --> 00:01:01,025
(Howard:)which foot do you
flush the toilet with?

